  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "No login requirement as instructed by user choice.",
    "Use text logo 'FANCHI' in high-impact italic Barlow Condensed or heavy sans typography.",
    "Implement photo upload drag & drop with preview thumbnail, remove button, and consent checkbox (must be checked to enable 'GENERATE VISUAL').",
    "Implement the full FANCHI catalog experience with swatch gradients, finish badges (Candy, Color Shift, PET, TPU), material filter tabs, and color codes.",
    "Integrate calls to backend /api/generate-wrap endpoint sending car photo and product metadata, with fallback handling for Gemini API failures.",
    "Support both error states exactly as defined: 'Unable to generate your FANCHI wrap visual right now. Please try again.' and 'FANCHI AI is currently busy. Please try again in a moment.'",
    "Ensure 'TRY ANOTHER COLOR' keeps the currently uploaded photo intact and lets the user pick a new FANCHI product immediately.",
    "Provide interactive Before/After image comparison slider and side-by-side toggle view.",
    "Include high quality mock visual fallback generation if backend Gemini key is missing so user can thoroughly test visualizer flow.",
    "Attach data-testid to every interactive component (buttons, inputs, checkboxes, sliders, cards)."
  ]
}